cff-version: 1.2.0
title: gpt-image-cookbook
message: "If you use this cookbook in research or tooling, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ghelbur
    given-names: Eugeniu
    alias: eugeniughelbur
repository-code: "https://github.com/eugeniughelbur/gpt-image-cookbook"
url: "https://github.com/eugeniughelbur/gpt-image-cookbook"
abstract: >
  A multi-provider AI image generation cookbook bundling a curated prompt
  gallery, an agentic skill runbook (Claude Code / Codex / OpenClaw / Hermes),
  and a Python CLI (`gic`) wrapping OpenAI gpt-image-2, Google Imagen, and
  Flux under a unified interface for text-to-image, reference-image edits,
  inpainting, and multi-reference workflows.
keywords:
  - image-generation
  - text-to-image
  - openai
  - gpt-image-2
  - imagen
  - flux
  - prompt-engineering
  - prompt-library
  - agent-skill
  - claude-code-plugin
license: MIT
